    "body": "### Contact Details (e.g. Tox ID or email)\n\n3719CE6662EDAE53F9E1A24FCFE87B22DC8E0B1D1B10751B11FFF90E6D0A6F60DCAB4057155A\n\n### Feature Description\n\nHi,\n\nSend notification `only if mentioned`  but globally.\n\nI know there's an option `only if mentioned` in conference room. \n\nThe present feature request is about implementing an option to apply this behaviour globally.\n\nThank you\n\nDan\n\n\n\n### Contribution\n\n- [ ] I would like to contribute to this feature",
